WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.381
Never raised.

00:00:01.391 --> 00:00:03.004
Not since 1985.

00:00:03.104 --> 00:00:05.561
Costco's hot dog and soda:

00:00:05.571 --> 00:00:06.708
still $1.50.

00:00:06.808 --> 00:00:09.182
With inflation, it would cost over four

00:00:09.192 --> 00:00:10.113
dollars.

00:00:10.123 --> 00:00:12.829
Its founder reportedly told the CEO:

00:00:12.854 --> 00:00:14.582
raise it, and I'll kill you.

00:00:14.592 --> 00:00:18.076
In 2013, Costco swapped
Coca-Cola for Pepsi

00:00:18.086 --> 00:00:19.633
to hold the price.

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:22.103
Over 100 million sold a year.

00:00:22.113 --> 00:00:23.194
So who pays?

00:00:23.294 --> 00:00:23.799
You do.

00:00:23.809 --> 00:00:26.885
Your $65 membership brings in most of

00:00:26.895 --> 00:00:28.382
Costco's profit.
